{"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":1,"result":{"capabilities":{"tools":{"listChanged":true}},"instructions":"codegraph indexes this repository's code into a call and symbol graph; try codegraph_explore first for a where-is-X or how-does-Y-work question, since it returns verbatim source plus call paths in one call. Every tool accepts an optional path argument; omitting it uses this server's own working directory. An empty tool list means this repository has no index yet, so run codegraph init to fix it, not that the server is broken. Tools appear automatically once an index exists, with no client restart required.","protocolVersion":"2025-11-25","serverInfo":{"name":"codegraph","version":"<VERSION>"}}}
